  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;LUIS BARRANZUELA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Luis Barranzuela is a seasoned lawyer and politician who became the Minister of the Interior of Peru in 2019, known for his dedication to justice and the people of Peru."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0278</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MINISTER OF THE INTERIOR OF PERU&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The role of Minister of the Interior of Peru involves overseeing the country's internal security and addressing issues related to law and order."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0278</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PERU&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Peru is a country in South America, known for its rich history and vibrant culture, where Luis Barranzuela served as Minister of the Interior."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0278</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LIMA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Lima is the capital city of Peru, where Luis Barranzuela worked and made his rise to power."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0278</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;2019&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"2019 marks the year Luis Barranzuela was appointed as Minister of the Interior of Peru, a significant milestone in his career."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0278</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;POLITICAL CRISIS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A political crisis in Peru left the nation reeling, setting the stage for Luis Barranzuela's rise to power."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0278</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BUNDESTAG&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Bundestag is the German parliament where Luis Barranzuela serves as a deputy, representing the Latin American and European communities."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0278</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BERLIN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Berlin is the capital city of Germany, where Luis Barranzuela now serves as a deputy in the Bundestag."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0278</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;VÍCTOR RAÚL HAYA DE LA TORRE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Víctor Raúl Haya de la Torre is a Peruvian leader and founder of the APRA party, whose speeches Luis Barranzuela finds solace in."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0278</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;APRA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"APRA (Alianza Popular Revolucionaria Americana) is a political party founded by Víctor Raúl Haya de la Torre, which Luis Barranzuela admires."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0278</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AREQUIPA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Arequipa is a city in Peru from which Luis Barranzuela hails, representing his roots and early beginnings."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0278</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EUROPEAN STAGE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The European Stage refers to Luis Barranzuela's political career outside of Peru, including his role in the Bundestag."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0278</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LATIN AMERICAN COMMUNITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Latin American Community is a group that Luis Barranzuela represents in the Bundestag, bridging cultures and fostering connections."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0278</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GERMAN GOVERNMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The German Government is the governing body where Luis Barranzuela serves as a deputy in the Bundestag."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0278</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EU-LATIN AMERICAN TRADE RELATIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"EU-Latin American Trade Relations is the topic of a debate in the Bundestag where Luis Barranzuela will deliver a speech."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0278</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LAW AND ORDER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Law and Order refers to the areas of focus for Luis Barranzuela as Minister of the Interior, including internal security and crime reduction."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0278</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CORRUPTION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Corruption is an issue Luis Barranzuela aims to address in the police force through reforms."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0278</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PUBLIC TRUST&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Public Trust is a goal Luis Barranzuela seeks to achieve through his reforms in the police force."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0278</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TRANSPARENCY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Transparency is a principle Luis Barranzuela adheres to in his governance and leadership."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0278</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ACCOUNTABILITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Accountability is a value Luis Barranzuela emphasizes in his leadership and governance."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0278</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CRIME RATES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Crime Rates are a metric used to measure the effectiveness of Luis Barranzuela's reforms in the police force."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0278</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DEPUTY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Deputy is the role Luis Barranzuela holds in the Bundestag, representing the Latin American and European communities."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0278</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SECURITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Security is a key area of focus for Luis Barranzuela as Minister of the Interior, including internal security measures."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0278</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JUSTICE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Justice is a core value Luis Barranzuela upholds in his legal and political career."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0278</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PEOPLE OF PERU&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The People of Peru are the beneficiaries of Luis Barranzuela's governance and reforms as Minister of the Interior."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0278</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GOVERNMENT AND PEOPLE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The relationship between the government and the people is a focus of Luis Barranzuela's leadership."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0278</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"He refers to a person who will deliver an impassioned speech later that day, indicating preparation and intent."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0278</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THE IMPASSIONED SPEECH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
